msgid "ANYA_TOMES@INCUBUS@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Incubus"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@INCUBUS@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"The Incubus are fey of trickery who found the way of the Darkfire by their "
"fellow lady counterparts known as the Glamour Fiend. They seem to enjoy "
"their lower rank and do it for the love of the game. While they don't seem "
"like much, the ritual allows them to punch above their weight. An appearance "
"of fragility favors them as they do well hiding their tracks - especially at "
"the speed they can move. Like the Glamour Fiends, the ritual has granted "
"them new abilities, including a twisted version of their innate Fey Guile."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@TEMPTRESS@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Glamour Fiend"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@TEMPTRESS@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Despite the name, these creatures are originally Fey who grants loyalty for "
"the power of revelry in return. They go through the ritual to become Glamour "
"Fiends which granted them new powers - some being twisted versions of "
"existing powers with many reports of them noting their inhumane speed. They "
"are greedy with a hunger for adrenaline that never ceases. The hunger is so "
"strong that it was noted there was an attempt to add a spirit of Shadowflame "
"Undead to these creatures but their inner hunger for revelry rejected the "
"spirits - it was only the Incubus they learned combining Shadowflame Undead "
"and Darkfire Fiend was near impossible. The Glamour Fiends are ranked higher "
"than the Incubus as these creatures are far more nefarious whose minds are "
"significantly more sick. Some call them Nymphs of Depravity."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@SHRIEKER@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Shrieker"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@SHRIEKER@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A soulless creature created in the {GLOBAL.STRUCTURE_UPGRADES."
"SHADOWFLAME_SANCTUARY_VECTRA.Hyperlink}. The ritual requires a cistern of "
"demon blood and an incantation with undead and fiend spirits present. The "
"{GLOBAL.UNITS.BONE_WYVERN.Hyperlink} is chosen as it's dragon spirit is "
"weakened so there is room to give it strength rather than risk the vessel "
"unable to contain the power of pure Darkfire. The dragon spirit is enslaved "
"by the incantation and the spirits fuse with it - strengthened by said "
"incantation. The result fusion severs the dragon spirit from it's free will "
"- it's mind consumed. You are left with a Darkfire abomination that only "
"knows to follow orders of it's creator."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@RITUAL@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Shadowflame Temple Ritual"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@RITUAL@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"The ritual to create Darkfire Fiends and Shadowflame Undead. The ritual "
"requires a cistern of demon blood and an incantation with undead and fiend "
"spirits present. The spirits fuse once in the vessel and becomes one within "
"the vessel. However, gaining both Darkfire Fiend and Shadowflame Undead is "
"near impossible as the collective power is far too strong when the vessel "
"itself is that of a strong spirit."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@DEMONOLOGIST@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Demonologist"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@DEMONOLOGIST@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"The Demonologists are helpers of THE RITUAL and provides the spirits "
"necessary to begin. They offer support by summoning Gremlins to sow chaos "
"onto the battlefield and give their allied Fiends and Undead the proper "
"boost against armies above their weight. Despite being of lower rank than "
"the Glamour Fiends, they are still given respect as equals due to their "
"necessity as heralds of the Shadowflame."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@NSTRIKER@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Nightstriker"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@NSTRIKER@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A military soldier of the Moon Druids. Can assassinate in the dead of night, "
"but even when caught, can turn into a strong boar. Many view it as a feeble "
"assassin not realizing it can turn into a hulking beast whose tusks "
"punctures a hole into anything. Those who attack the grove do not deserve a "
"proper burial as that is the way of the Midnight Boar."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@SABLEPRIEST@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Sable Priestess"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@SABLEPRIEST@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Magic artillery of the Moon Druids. These individuals are trained on how to "
"support while doing offense - not the other way around like their softer "
"counterpart, Moongrove Priestess. Their animal form was chosen so they may "
"punish those who wish to get into the face of those who champion the moon "
"spirits. Those who attack the Sable Serpent often can have their vision "
"slightly blurred by mist only the attacker can see. Such trickery is the way "
"of the Sable Serpent."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONGUARD@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Moonguard"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONGUARD@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Dedicated defenders of the Moon Druids. They represent not only the "
"sturdiness of the Moon Druids but the duality of nature. They help when they "
"can to save fellow warriors from death, but the best protection against "
"enemies is when the enemies are dead. The wrath of nature is the way of the "
"Lunar Wolf whose claws digs deep into any foe."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONPRIEST@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Moongrove Priestess"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONPRIEST@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Magic artillery of the Moon Druids but often referred to as the magic "
"cannon. In human form, they show the grace and punishment of the Moon "
"Druids. However, their monster form is anything but graceful. Swift with an "
"attack that can level many ferocious beasts. Despite their appearance as "
"appearing more soft than the Sable Priestess, this unit's alternate form "
"takes the cake in terms of offense. Swiftly annihilating the enemies when "
"they test the gracefulness of the Moon Druids is the way of the Moondust "
"Fairy."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@DHUNTER@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Dusk Hunter"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@DHUNTER@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"The scout of the Moon Druids. Blessed by the Moon Spirits to gain Fey Shield "
"to help strengthen their resolves against threats. It takes only one good "
"pierce to fell an enemy. Versatility and adaptability of the situation is "
"vital to this unit's purpose and is the way of the Midnight Raven."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONSEEKER@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Moonseeker"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONSEEKER@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"The moonseeker is a teacher of the young who seek to become Moon Druids. The "
"way of the Spider informs that those who seek to destroy the young shall be "
"webbed and to be eventually feasted on by the animal forms of the young."

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONRITUAL@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Moon Gaze Ritual"

msgid "ANYA_TOMES@MOONRITUAL@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A ritualistic test to see the resolve of the one being tested. The Lunar "
"Monarchs, typically a Godir, are the ones that provide the requirements "
"necessary to pass and who will be blessed with what. During the ritual, it "
"is the Moon Spirits who conducts the tests to see one's relationship with "
"nature. The Moon Spirits may advise the Moon Monarch on individuals that "
"peak their interest."
